@{
    ViewBag.Title = "About";
}
<h2>@ViewBag.Title</h2>
<h3>@ViewBag.Message</h3>

Create an application for document tracking. Access to the application must be secure through user authentication.
<br />
After logging in, the user displays a list of documents and menus with basic operations over a document (creating a new document, editing a document, and deleting a document).
<br />
Above the list of documents, the application must further support base operations such as filtering and sorting.
<br />
The list of documents will be stored in the SQL database. Data model design, emphasize the expandability of the data model.
<br />
<br />
Application requirements:
<ul>
    <li>Client - server solution</li>
    <li>The solution must be on the .NET Framework or .NET Core 2.0</li>
</ul>    
<br /> 

The client must be a web solution on some of the following platforms:
<ul>
    <li>ASP.NET MVC</li>
    <li>ASP.NET Core 2.0</li>
    <li>HTML / JavaScript - a solution like Single Page Application</li>
    <li>UX</li> 
</ul>
We recommend using the TypeScript and SPA framework, e.g. Angular, React, Vue.js (not a condition)
<br />
<br />
<p>The installation manual must be part of the solution.</p>
